# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Shaded lightcones"
msgstr "Arahan pemasangan untuk versi terkini Shaded lightcones"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Arahan pemasangan"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Arahan pemasangan {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, choose how you’re going to run and install the packages. There are two primary ways to do this:\n"
msgstr "Mula-mula, pilih cara anda akan menjalankan dan memasang pakej. Terdapat dua cara utama untuk melakukannya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 1: Install from PyPI](#option-1)\n"
msgstr "[Pilihan 1: Pasang daripada PyPI](#option-1)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 2: Install from Source](#option-2)\n"
msgstr "[Pilihan 2: Pasang daripada Sumber](#option-2)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prasyarat {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Mula-mula, cipta persekitaran minimum dengan hanya Python dipasang di dalamnya. Kami mengesyorkan penggunaan [persekitaran maya Python](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktifkan persekitaran baharu anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-1\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 1: Install from PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Pilihan 1: Pasang daripada PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The most straightforward way to install the `qiskit-addon-slc` package is via `PyPI`.\n"
msgstr "Cara paling mudah untuk memasang pakej `qiskit-addon-slc` ialah melalui `PyPI`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-2\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 2: Install from Source {#option-2-install-from-source}"
msgstr "Pilihan 2: Pasang daripada Sumber {#option-2-install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally, install from source.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda merancang untuk membangun dalam repositori atau menjalankan notebook secara setempat, pasang daripada sumber.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If so, the first step is to clone the `qiskit-addon-slc` repository.\n"
msgstr "Jika ya, langkah pertama ialah mengklon repositori `qiskit-addon-slc`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade `pip` and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "Seterusnya, naik taraf `pip` dan masuk ke dalam repositori.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-addon-slc` to the virtual environment. Install the notebook dependencies if you plan to run all the visualizations in the notebooks. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya ialah memasang `qiskit-addon-slc` ke dalam persekitaran maya. Pasang kebergantungan buku nota jika anda bercadang untuk menjalankan semua visualisasi dalam buku nota. Jika anda bercadang untuk membangun dalam repositori, pasang kebergantungan `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Laraskan pilihan di bawah mengikut keperluan anda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda telah memasang kebergantungan buku nota, anda boleh bermula dengan menjalankan buku nota dalam dokumentasi.\n"
